=== Q1.6-8 independent validation, human approval, governed version
# FCP records carry no validation/approval fields and no command transitions them; release build takes no FCP input:
FCP schema properties: ['cluster_key', 'confidence', 'created', 'created_at', 'evidence_strength', 'generic_failure_mode', 'id', 'next', 'packets', 'problem_statement', 'release_action', 'source_projects', 'state_class', 'status', 'suggested_framework_change', 'title', 'trigger', 'type']
  upstream        Upstream learning: prepare/submit sanitised framework lesson packets
  lessons         Framework lesson intake (canonical repository): cluster inbox packets into Framework Change Proposals
Commands:
  cluster  
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
